    {
      "id": "2D3DEFD4AE2D2603",
      "title": "You Were Here Before",
      "description": [
        "You wake beneath a memorial. Your name has been scraped away. Your hands remember a blade, but your mind remembers nothing.",
        "Open this book with its inventory button. Claim the archive below. Right-click the archive into the air to recover lost story tokens and see the world chapter.",
        "Story boss unlocks are shared across this server. Quest rewards and tutorial progress use FTB teams. Create a party before adventuring together.",
        "Story chapters unlock only after every required chapter milestone and its closing quest. Boss trophies are detected in your inventory; claim their quest rewards to advance the story; optional tutorials remain available from the start."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "tasks": [
